# VAAKKU

# --- Models and large binaries (build plan §4) ---
models/**
!models/MANIFEST.md
app/libs/*.aar
litert_npu_runtime_libraries/

# --- Build output ---
**/build/
.gradle/
.kotlin/
*.apks
*.aab

# --- Machine-local ---
local.properties
.idea/
*.iml
captures/

# --- OS noise ---
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store

# --- Human handoff material: reference assets, not app source.
#     Kept on disk so the human can move files around without re-downloading,
#     but never committed (it is ~70 MB of models, AARs and sample repos).
handoff/

# Windows shortcuts. One of these gets created by an accidental drag-drop in
# Explorer; it points at the repo root and is not app source.
*.lnk

# The human's recordings as they came off the phone, at 44.1 kHz.
# tools/asr_prescreen/prepare_testaudio.py rewrites testdata/testaudio/*.wav to
# the 16 kHz the build plan §11.1 specifies and drops the originals here. They
# are NOT committed again because commit 3ee21a8 already holds them byte-exact
# at their original paths — this folder is a local convenience, not the backup.
testdata/testaudio/original_44k/

# The packet CLI keeps its source HTML beside every PDF it prints (§7.4), and
# that HTML embeds the app's four fonts as base64 — about 950 KB of bytes that
# are already in the repo under app/src/main/res/font/, rewritten on every
# render. The PDF next to it is the artefact worth reviewing, so that is what
# gets committed.
evidence/**/packet*.html
